    "chunk_text": "\u00f0urh \u00dees tima is endenext and ende \u00feyssere worulde, and menn beo\u00f0 geworhte wolice him betwynan, swa \u00deonne \u00f0inc\u00f0 \u00feam arleasum swylce hi \u00e6fre motan libban, and ne cunnon \u00f0one cwyde \u00fee God cw\u00e6\u00f0 be \u00d0a synd blodige weras \u00f0e wyrca\u00f0 manslihtas, and \u00f0a\u00f0e manna sawla beswica\u00f0 to forwyrde. \u00d0a sceolan geendian swy\u00f0e yfelum dea\u00f0e, gif hi \u00e6r geendunge heora yfel ne gebeta\u00f0. And \u00f0eah \u00fee hi sume lybbon leng \u00f0onne hi sceoldon, for Godes ge\u00f0ylde \u00fe\u00e6t him ne frema\u00f0 naht, ac hi Godes wisdom clypa\u00f0, and cwy\u00f0 to eallum mannum mid f\u00e6derlicre lufe \u00feus f\u00e6gere tihtende, Min Hafa \u00fee truwa on God of ealre \u00f0inre heortan, and ne truwa \u00f0u na swy\u00f0e on \u00feinre snoternysse. \u00deenc \u00e6fre embe God on eallum \u00f0inum wegum, and he sylf gewissa\u00f0 wel \u00feine fare. Eadig bi\u00f0 se man se\u00f0e gemet wisdom, for\u00f0an \u00fee se wisdom is selra \u00feone scinende gold, and he ana is \u00de\u00e6t is se wisdom, \u00fe\u00e6t man wislice libbe, and his d\u00e6da gefadige to his Drihtnes willan, \u00fe\u00e6t he edlean.",
